This work consists of times-math.dtx, times-math.ins, times-math.tex,
times-math-cn.tex, times-math-doc.tex, times-math.ltx, times-math-glyphs.tex,
build.lua, Makefile, README.md, LICENSE, and the scripts and fixtures in
dev/ and test/. The derived files are times-math.sty, times-math.pdf,
times-math-cn.pdf, times-math-glyphs.pdf, test/test-coverage.tex, and
times-math-integrals.otf. The font's manifest and license are distributed as
MANIFEST-times-math-integrals.txt and GUST-FONT-LICENSE.txt.

The glyph reference is adapted from unicode-math's unimath-symbols
(Will Robertson and contributors) and euler-math's unimath-euler.ltx
(Daniel Flipo), distributed under LPPL 1.3c or later.

times-math-integrals.otf is a renamed derivative of TeX Gyre Termes Math,
distributed under the GUST Font License 1.0. See its manifest for the
original authors and source font. Times New Roman, XITS Math, and the
original TeX Gyre Termes Math are not bundled.

Local caches, build intermediates, and generated test results are not part
of the distribution.
